      "product-tabs": {
        "type": "product-tabs",
        "settings": {
          "tab1_title": "Details",
          "tab1_content": "<p>Let your inner compass guide you. The CHENSHA Cinnabar Bracelet is a token of direction, purpose, and quiet confidence. A luminous stone sits at the center, illuminating your way forward.</p><ul><li>Natural cinnabar beads, hand-selected</li><li>Bead diameter - 8mm / 10mm / 12mm options</li><li>Adjustable cord - fits wrist sizes 15-19cm</li><li>99% pure cinnabar from Tongren, China</li><li>Handcrafted by master artisans</li><li>Hypoallergenic & made for everyday wear</li></ul>",
          "tab2_title": "Symbolism",
          "tab2_content": "<p>For over two millennia, cinnabar has been revered as the Stone of Life in Chinese culture.</p><ul><li>Represents good fortune, protection, and vitality</li><li>Worn by emperors and scholars through every dynasty</li><li>Believed to ward off negative energy</li><li>Symbol of passion, creativity, and confidence</li></ul>",
          "tab3_title": "Materials",
          "tab3_content": "<p>Sourced from the ancient mines of Tongren, Guizhou - the birthplace of the world's finest cinnabar.</p><ul><li>99% pure natural cinnabar (HgS)</li><li>Hand-polished to a deep, luminous crimson</li><li>Waxed cotton cord, adjustable</li><li>Gold vermeil accents (18k gold over sterling silver)</li></ul>",
          "tab4_title": "Care",
          "tab4_content": "<p>Caring for your CHENSHA piece ensures it stays beautiful for generations.</p><ul><li>Avoid prolonged contact with water, perfume, or chemicals</li><li>Wipe gently with a soft, dry cloth after wear</li><li>Store in the included velvet pouch when not in use</li><li>Keep away from direct sunlight and extreme heat</li></ul>"
        }
